+// Wrapper for DrawThemeTextEx() taking the same arguments as it.
+//
+// This function only appeared in Vista and, more importantly, can't be even
+// statically imported without breaking loading of the application under XP, so
+// it is always loaded dynamically. If it's not available, i.e. when running
+// under XP, this wrapper falls back to the simpler DrawThemeText() which
